@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor User
participant "UI Layer\n(RegisterView)" as UI
participant "Logic Layer\n(UserService)" as Logic
database "Database\n(UserRepository)" as DB

User -> UI : 1. Enter details (Username, Password)
activate UI
UI -> Logic : 2. Registration Request
activate Logic
Logic -> DB : 3. Check if Username exists
activate DB
DB --> Logic : 4. Username is available
deactivate DB
Logic -> Logic : 5. Hash Password (Security)
Logic -> DB : 6. Save new User Object
activate DB
DB --> Logic : 7. Confirm Save
deactivate DB
Logic --> UI : 8. Registration Success
deactivate Logic
UI --> User : 9. Show Success & Redirect to Login
deactivate UI
@enduml